      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجْهَاجٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>that brays vehemently.</i> (K.)
A word imitative of the sound which a stallioncamel makes in his braying. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجْهَاجٌ</span>
<i>Wont to take fright, and to run away.</i> (S, K.)
